Probability is communicated at once with colour, pattern, label, percentage and uncertainty interval.
final test
The test flags the most marked change in each series (p-value < {0}). A change in the catalogue does not imply a change in seismicity: it usually reflects the evolution of the network, the processing or the reporting criteria. The models are validated on recent blocks to limit this effect.
