That is why the catalogue is reorganised into zone-periods: each zone, at each date, described only by what had already happened (how many recent events, how large, how long ago), and with a label: was there at least one event above the threshold in the following {0} days?
Percentage of each period's events in the project's five depth classes.
Percentage of records with no data by variable and year. Missing values are not imputed: they are kept as missing and the models handle them explicitly.
