Precision
Precision versus recall as the decision threshold varies. The dotted line is the prevalence ({0}), equivalent to a model with no information. Largest area: Hybrid.
Precision versus recall as the decision threshold varies. The dotted line is the prevalence ({0}), equivalent to a model with no information. Largest area: Baseline.
Precision versus recall as the decision threshold varies. The dotted line is the prevalence ({0}), equivalent to a model with no information. Largest area: Poisson / NB.
Precision and recall
Precision: of the zones flagged, how many had an event. Recall: of the zones with an event, how many were flagged.
Predicting would mean saying when, where and how large an earthquake will be; nobody can do that. Forecasting probabilistically means estimating how often something happens in similar situations, and stating it with its uncertainty.
Preferences for this session. The platform uses no accounts or persistent storage: they reset when the tab is closed, except theme, language and time zone, which travel in the link.
